lass="ib-glyph" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span></button><a class="icon-button" href="/en/trip/" aria-label="ทริปของคุณ"><span class="ib-glyph" aria-hidden="true">◫</span><span class="qs-badge" data-trip-count hidden>0</span></a><a class="header-map" href="/en/map/">Open map ↗</a></div></header><main id="main"><div class="intro"><a class="eyebrow" href="/en/">Takua Pa 101 / Old Town Guide</a><h1>When the city has an appointment</h1><p class="lead">Stories of faith and traditions in the town's calendar</p></div><p class="calendar-note">Periods per original document · Not yet a confirmed schedule for the current year</p><div class="traditions-list"><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">01</span><span class="event-name">New Year's Dawn Almsgiving</span><span class="event-period">January 1</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Activities in the traditions section of the municipal brochure</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/new-year-alms/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">02</span><span class="event-name">Takua Pa Governor Worship Ceremony</span><span class="event-period">February</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/governor-wall/">Governor’s Residence Wall</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/ruler-ceremony/">Read details from document ↗</a></div></details><details class="tradition"><summary><span class="event-no">03</span><span class="event-name">Relic Procession to Khao Phra Bat</span><span class="event-period">Makha Bucha Day</span><span class="expand-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="event-body"><p>Related places: <a href="/en/places/wat-boromthat/">Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (the town's relic temple)</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/en/traditions/relic-procession/">Read details from 